{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-10510","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9724","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9725","text":" -- Semantic Vector Retrieval Capability"}]},{"id":"blk-10511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9726","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9727","text":" is a concrete capability page for the [&] Protocol's "},{"id":"spn-9728","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-9729","text":" primitive."}]},{"id":"blk-10512","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9730","text":"It describes the capability interface for "},{"id":"spn-9731","marks":["bold"],"text":"semantic vector retrieval"},{"id":"spn-9732","text":": a memory system that embeds documents and knowledge corpora into vector space and retrieves them by similarity. This is the canonical approach for corpus-level semantic search, knowledge-base lookup, and context enrichment over large unstructured or semi-structured document sets."}]},{"id":"blk-10513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9733","text":"This page is part of the capability registry and documentation hub. It is intended to be useful both to humans and to downstream generation systems."}]},{"id":"blk-10514","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9734","text":"1. Definition"}]},{"id":"blk-10515","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9735","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9736","text":" is the capability for:"}]},{"id":"blk-10516","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10518","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9737","text":"semantic similarity retrieval over embedded documents"}]}],"id":"blk-10517","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10520","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9738","text":"corpus-level knowledge-base lookup"}]}],"id":"blk-10519","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9739","text":"context enrichment with semantically relevant material"}]}],"id":"blk-10521","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10524","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9740","text":"inserting and updating embedded documents for future retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-10523","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10525","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9741","text":"Unlike graph memory, vector memory operates over a "},{"id":"spn-9742","marks":["bold"],"text":"flat embedding space"},{"id":"spn-9743","text":". There is no explicit relationship structure. Retrieval is based on proximity in vector space: what is semantically similar to the query, not what is structurally connected."}]},{"id":"blk-10526","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9744","text":"That makes it especially useful when an agent must answer questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-10527","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9745","text":"What documents in this corpus are most relevant to this query?"}]}],"id":"blk-10528","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10531","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9746","text":"Which support articles best match this customer question?"}]}],"id":"blk-10530","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9747","text":"What prior research material is semantically closest to this claim?"}]}],"id":"blk-10532","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9748","text":"What context should be injected to ground this response?"}]}],"id":"blk-10534","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10536","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9749","text":"In protocol terms, the canonical capability identifier is:"}]},{"id":"blk-10537","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10539","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9750","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"}]}],"id":"blk-10538","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10540","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9751","text":"2. Why this capability exists"}]},{"id":"blk-10541","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9752","text":"A large share of important agent workloads involve retrieval over document corpora that do not have explicit relational structure. The documents exist as text, and the retrieval problem is: find what is semantically relevant."}]},{"id":"blk-10542","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9753","text":"Examples:"}]},{"id":"blk-10543","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10545","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9754","text":"support knowledge bases where articles must be matched to customer questions"}]}],"id":"blk-10544","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9755","text":"research corpora where papers, notes, and claims must be surfaced by meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-10546","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10549","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9756","text":"policy and compliance libraries where the right section must be found for a given situation"}]}],"id":"blk-10548","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9757","text":"product documentation where the answer to a technical question lives somewhere in a large set of pages"}]}],"id":"blk-10550","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9758","text":"A vector retrieval capability is useful whenever:"}]},{"id":"blk-10553","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9759","text":"the corpus is large enough that keyword search alone is insufficient"}]}],"id":"blk-10554","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9760","text":"retrieval should be based on meaning, not just exact terms"}]}],"id":"blk-10556","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10559","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9761","text":"the agent needs grounded context from a knowledge base before reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-10558","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10561","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9762","text":"documents should be retrievable without requiring manual tagging or graph construction"}]}],"id":"blk-10560","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-10562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9763","text":"This is why "},{"id":"spn-9764","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9765","text":" is a distinct capability rather than just a provider detail."}]},{"id":"blk-10563","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9766","text":"3. Capability family position"}]},{"id":"blk-10564","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9767","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9768","text":" sits inside the "},{"id":"spn-9769","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-9770","text":" namespace."}]},{"id":"blk-10565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9771","text":"Related memory capabilities include:"}]},{"id":"blk-10566","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9772","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9773","text":" -- graph-structured relationship memory"}]}],"id":"blk-10567","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9774","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-9775","text":" -- replayable prior experiences or sessions"}]}],"id":"blk-10569","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9776","text":"A useful shorthand:"}]},{"id":"blk-10572","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9777","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9778","text":" = semantic similarity retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-10573","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9779","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9780","text":" = connected durable knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-10575","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9781","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-9782","text":" = prior experience replay"}]}],"id":"blk-10577","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9783","text":"How these differ in practice:"}]},{"id":"blk-10580","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10582","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9784","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9785","text":" finds what is "},{"id":"spn-9786","marks":["bold"],"text":"similar"},{"id":"spn-9787","text":". It operates over embeddings in a flat space. There is no topology, no edges, no relationship structure. Results are ranked by distance."}]}],"id":"blk-10581","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9788","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9789","text":" finds what is "},{"id":"spn-9790","marks":["bold"],"text":"connected"},{"id":"spn-9791","text":". It operates over nodes and edges. It can traverse dependency chains, identify feedback loops, and use kappa-aware routing to decide whether cyclic structure requires deliberation."}]}],"id":"blk-10583","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9792","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-9793","text":" finds what "},{"id":"spn-9794","marks":["bold"],"text":"happened before"},{"id":"spn-9795","text":". It stores session-level history and replayable experience. It is scoped to temporal sequences, not corpus-level knowledge."}]}],"id":"blk-10585","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10587","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9796","text":"In many real systems, these capabilities compose rather than compete."}]},{"id":"blk-10588","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9797","text":"4. Capability contract summary"}]},{"id":"blk-10589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9798","text":"Below is a representative contract for "},{"id":"spn-9799","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9800","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-10590","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9801","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/capability-contract.schema.json\", \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"description\": \"Semantic vector retrieval contract for similarity search, document upsert, and context enrichment over embedded knowledge corpora.\", \"operations\": { \"search\": { \"in\": \"query_context\", \"out\": \"retrieval_hits\", \"description\": \"Retrieve semantically similar documents from the vector store given a query context.\", \"deterministic\": false, \"side_effects\": false }, \"upsert\": { \"in\": \"document_payload\", \"out\": \"ack\", \"description\": \"Insert or update an embedded document in the vector store.\", \"deterministic\": true, \"side_effects\": true }, \"enrich\": { \"in\": \"query_context\", \"out\": \"enriched_context\", \"description\": \"Augment an existing context object with semantically relevant material from the corpus.\", \"deterministic\": false, \"side_effects\": false } }, \"accepts_from\": [ \"&reason.*\", \"&memory.episodic\", \"query_context\", \"document_payload\" ], \"feeds_into\": [ \"&reason.*\", \"&memory.graph\", \"output\" ], \"a2a_skills\": [ \"semantic-retrieval\", \"knowledge-base-enrichment\" ] } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10591","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9802","text":"Interpretation"}]},{"id":"blk-10592","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9803","text":"This contract says that "},{"id":"spn-9804","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9805","text":" can:"}]},{"id":"blk-10593","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10595","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9806","text":"search for semantically similar documents from a query context"}]}],"id":"blk-10594","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10597","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9807","text":"upsert new or updated documents into the vector store"}]}],"id":"blk-10596","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10599","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9808","text":"enrich an existing context with relevant semantic material for downstream use"}]}],"id":"blk-10598","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9809","text":"It also says that it composes especially naturally with:"}]},{"id":"blk-10601","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10603","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9810","text":"reasoning capabilities downstream"}]}],"id":"blk-10602","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10605","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9811","text":"graph memory downstream (for hybrid retrieval)"}]}],"id":"blk-10604","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10607","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9812","text":"episodic memory upstream (to ground retrieval in session context)"}]}],"id":"blk-10606","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10608","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9813","text":"5. Operations"}]},{"id":"blk-10609","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9814","marks":["code"],"text":"search"}]},{"id":"blk-10610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9815","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-10611","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10613","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9816","text":"retrieve documents or passages that are semantically similar to the query"}]}],"id":"blk-10612","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9817","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-10615","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10617","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9818","marks":["code"],"text":"query_context"}]}],"id":"blk-10616","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9819","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-10619","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9820","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieval_hits"}]}],"id":"blk-10620","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10622","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9821","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-10623","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10625","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9822","text":"the agent needs to find relevant material from a corpus based on meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-10624","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10626","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9823","marks":["code"],"text":"upsert"}]},{"id":"blk-10627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9824","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-10628","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9825","text":"insert a new document or update an existing one in the vector store"}]}],"id":"blk-10629","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10631","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9826","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-10632","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10634","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9827","marks":["code"],"text":"document_payload"}]}],"id":"blk-10633","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10635","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9828","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-10636","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9829","marks":["code"],"text":"ack"}]}],"id":"blk-10637","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10639","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9830","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-10640","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9831","text":"the agent should add or refresh knowledge in the corpus"}]}],"id":"blk-10641","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10643","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9832","marks":["code"],"text":"enrich"}]},{"id":"blk-10644","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9833","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-10645","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9834","text":"augment an existing context object with semantically relevant material from the corpus"}]}],"id":"blk-10646","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9835","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-10649","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10651","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9836","marks":["code"],"text":"query_context"},{"id":"spn-9837","text":" or compatible context object"}]}],"id":"blk-10650","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9838","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-10653","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10655","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9839","marks":["code"],"text":"enriched_context"}]}],"id":"blk-10654","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10656","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9840","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-10657","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10659","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9841","text":"another capability has already produced a signal and semantic context should make it more useful"}]}],"id":"blk-10658","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10660","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9842","text":"6. Architecture patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-10661","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9843","text":"Pattern A: policy-grounded support"}]},{"id":"blk-10662","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9844","text":"~~~text customer_query"}]},{"id":"blk-10663","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9845","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10664","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9846","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-10665","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10667","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9847","text":"vector memory retrieves relevant support articles and policy documents"}]}],"id":"blk-10666","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9848","text":"episodic memory adds prior session context for this customer"}]}],"id":"blk-10668","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9849","text":"reasoning evaluates the best response grounded in policy"}]}],"id":"blk-10670","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-10672","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9850","text":"This is one of the strongest "},{"id":"spn-9851","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9852","text":" patterns for customer-facing agents."}]},{"id":"blk-10673","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9853","text":"Pattern B: hybrid retrieval"}]},{"id":"blk-10674","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9854","text":"~~~text research_query"}]},{"id":"blk-10675","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9855","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10676","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9856","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-10677","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10679","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9857","text":"vector memory retrieves semantically relevant documents"}]}],"id":"blk-10678","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10681","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9858","text":"graph memory adds relationship and dependency context"}]}],"id":"blk-10680","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10683","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9859","text":"reasoning synthesizes evidence from both retrieval modes"}]}],"id":"blk-10682","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-10684","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9860","text":"This combines breadth (vector) with structure (graph)."}]},{"id":"blk-10685","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9861","text":"Pattern C: corpus ingestion"}]},{"id":"blk-10686","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9862","text":"~~~text new_document"}]},{"id":"blk-10687","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9863","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10688","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9864","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-10689","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10691","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9865","text":"the document is embedded and stored for future retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-10690","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-10692","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9866","text":"This is the write path. It keeps the corpus current."}]},{"id":"blk-10693","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9867","text":"7. Architecture diagram"}]},{"id":"blk-10694","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9868","text":"A simple mental model for "},{"id":"spn-9869","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9870","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-10695","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9871","text":"~~~text +---------------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10696","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9872","text":"+---------+-----------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10697","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9873","text":"v +---------------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10698","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9874","text":"+---------+-----------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10699","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9875","text":"+--------------+--------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10700","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9876","text":"v              v              v +----------------+ +------------+ +---------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10701","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9877","text":"+------+---------+ +------------+ +---------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10702","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9878","text":"v +---------------------+"}]},{"id":"blk-10703","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9879","text":"+---------------------+ ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10704","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9880","text":"8. Example declaration"}]},{"id":"blk-10705","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9881","text":"A concrete "},{"id":"spn-9882","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-9883","text":" fragment:"}]},{"id":"blk-10706","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9884","text":"~~~json { \"&memory.vector\": { \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"support-kb\" } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10707","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9885","text":"A fuller declaration ("},{"id":"spn-9886","marks":["code"],"text":"customer-support.ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-9887","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-10708","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9888","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"SupportAgent\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&memory.vector\": { \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"support-kb\" } }, \"&memory.episodic\": { \"provider\": \"default\", \"config\": { \"session_scope\": \"customer\" } }, \"&reason.argument\": { \"provider\": \"deliberatic\", \"config\": { \"governance\": \"standard\" } } }, \"provenance\": true } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10709","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9889","text":"A research-oriented declaration ("},{"id":"spn-9890","marks":["code"],"text":"research-agent.ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-9891","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-10710","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9892","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"ResearchAgent\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&memory.vector\": { \"provider\": \"weaviate\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"research-corpus\" } }, \"&memory.graph\": { \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"research-kg\" } }, \"&reason.argument\": { \"provider\": \"deliberatic\", \"config\": { \"governance\": \"constitutional\" } } }, \"provenance\": true } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10711","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9893","text":"9. Example API shape"}]},{"id":"blk-10712","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9894","text":"A provider-specific API may vary, but the protocol-level shape can look like this."}]},{"id":"blk-10713","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9895","text":"Search request"}]},{"id":"blk-10714","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9896","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"search\", \"input\": { \"query_context\": { \"query\": \"how to reset account password after lockout\", \"top_k\": 5 } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10715","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9897","text":"Search response"}]},{"id":"blk-10716","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9898","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"search\", \"output\": { \"retrieval_hits\": [ { \"document_id\": \"kb-article-2041\", \"title\": \"Account lockout recovery procedure\", \"score\": 0.94, \"snippet\": \"When an account is locked after repeated failed login attempts...\" }, { \"document_id\": \"kb-article-1893\", \"title\": \"Password reset flow for enterprise accounts\", \"score\": 0.87, \"snippet\": \"Enterprise accounts use a separate reset pathway...\" } ] } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10717","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9899","text":"Enrich request"}]},{"id":"blk-10718","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9900","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"enrich\", \"input\": { \"query_context\": { \"query\": \"customer reports inability to access dashboard after migration\", \"top_k\": 3 } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10719","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9901","text":"Enrich response"}]},{"id":"blk-10720","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9902","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.vector\", \"operation\": \"enrich\", \"output\": { \"enriched_context\": { \"relevant_articles\": [ \"kb-article-3102\", \"kb-article-2891\" ], \"relevant_policies\": [ \"migration-access-policy-v2\" ], \"semantic_summary\": \"Two knowledge base articles and one migration policy document are relevant to post-migration dashboard access issues.\" } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10721","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9903","text":"10. Compatible providers"}]},{"id":"blk-10722","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9904","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9905","text":" is a capability interface. Compatible providers are implementations that can satisfy the contract."}]},{"id":"blk-10723","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9906","text":"Representative providers:"}]},{"id":"blk-10724","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10726","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9907","marks":["code"],"text":"pgvector"},{"id":"spn-9908","text":" (default)"}]}],"id":"blk-10725","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10728","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9909","marks":["code"],"text":"weaviate"}]}],"id":"blk-10727","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10730","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9910","text":"custom embedding-backed retrieval services wrapped behind a protocol-compatible surface"}]}],"id":"blk-10729","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10732","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9911","text":"managed vector database services with a compatible API shape"}]}],"id":"blk-10731","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10733","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9912","text":"Current default ecosystem fit"}]},{"id":"blk-10734","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9913","marks":["code"],"text":"pgvector"},{"id":"spn-9914","text":" is the default provider in this repository"}]}],"id":"blk-10735","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10737","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9915","text":"Why it fits:"}]},{"id":"blk-10738","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10740","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9916","text":"widely deployed and operationally simple"}]}],"id":"blk-10739","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10742","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9917","text":"embeds directly into PostgreSQL infrastructure many teams already run"}]}],"id":"blk-10741","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10744","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9918","text":"suitable for search, upsert, and enrichment workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-10743","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10746","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9919","text":"no separate cluster required for moderate-scale corpora"}]}],"id":"blk-10745","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10747","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9920","text":"Alternative provider: Weaviate"}]},{"id":"blk-10748","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9921","text":"Why it fits:"}]},{"id":"blk-10749","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10751","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9922","text":"purpose-built for vector search at scale"}]}],"id":"blk-10750","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9923","text":"supports hybrid search (vector + keyword)"}]}],"id":"blk-10752","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10755","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9924","text":"suitable for larger corpora or workloads requiring dedicated vector infrastructure"}]}],"id":"blk-10754","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10756","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9925","text":"11. A2A-facing skills"}]},{"id":"blk-10757","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9926","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-9927","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9928","text":" capability may advertise skills such as:"}]},{"id":"blk-10758","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10760","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9929","marks":["code"],"text":"semantic-retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-10759","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10762","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9930","marks":["code"],"text":"knowledge-base-enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-10761","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9931","text":"These skills are useful when generating A2A agent cards from a declaration, because they let an externally visible agent surface say more than just \"has memory.\" A downstream agent or orchestrator can discover that this agent offers semantic retrieval as a specific skill."}]},{"id":"blk-10764","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9932","text":"12. Governance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-10765","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9933","text":"Vector retrieval often serves as the grounding layer for agent responses, so governance matters."}]},{"id":"blk-10766","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9934","text":"Examples of governance constraints that commonly pair with "},{"id":"spn-9935","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9936","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-10767","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9937","text":"Hard constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-10768","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10770","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9938","text":"never return restricted or access-controlled documents outside authorized workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-10769","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10772","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9939","text":"never surface confidential knowledge-base content to unauthorized callers"}]}],"id":"blk-10771","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10774","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9940","text":"always preserve audit trail for retrieval-grounded decision support"}]}],"id":"blk-10773","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10775","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9941","text":"Soft constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-10776","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10778","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9942","text":"prefer higher-confidence retrieval hits when multiple results are available"}]}],"id":"blk-10777","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10780","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9943","text":"prefer recent documents when relevance scores are similar"}]}],"id":"blk-10779","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10782","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9944","text":"prefer policy-tagged documents over untagged material in compliance-sensitive domains"}]}],"id":"blk-10781","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10783","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9945","text":"Escalation triggers"}]},{"id":"blk-10784","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10786","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9946","text":"escalate when no retrieval hits meet the minimum relevance threshold"}]}],"id":"blk-10785","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10788","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9947","text":"escalate when retrieved material conflicts with known policy"}]}],"id":"blk-10787","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10789","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9948","text":"Standard retrieval governance applies: the governance mode for "},{"id":"spn-9949","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9950","text":" is straightforward compared to graph or reasoning capabilities, because the operation is read-heavy and the primary risk is surfacing wrong or restricted content rather than taking irreversible action."}]},{"id":"blk-10790","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9951","text":"13. Provenance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-10791","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9952","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9953","text":" should participate in the provenance chain."}]},{"id":"blk-10792","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9954","text":"Representative provenance record:"}]},{"id":"blk-10793","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9955","text":"~~~json { \"source\": \"&memory.vector\", \"provider\": \"pgvector\", \"operation\": \"search\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T14:23:07Z\", \"input_hash\": \"sha256:3e4f...\", \"output_hash\": \"sha256:9a1b...\", \"parent_hash\": \"sha256:0000...\" } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-10794","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9956","text":"This matters because vector retrieval results often directly ground downstream reasoning. If an agent responds to a customer based on a retrieved article, or if a research agent cites a retrieved paper, the retrieval step should be auditable. Provenance makes it possible to trace which documents were surfaced and when."}]},{"id":"blk-10795","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9957","text":"14. Typical use cases"}]},{"id":"blk-10796","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9958","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9959","text":" is especially strong in the following domains."}]},{"id":"blk-10797","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9960","text":"Customer support"}]},{"id":"blk-10798","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10800","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9961","text":"knowledge-base article retrieval for customer questions"}]}],"id":"blk-10799","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10802","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9962","text":"policy document lookup for escalation decisions"}]}],"id":"blk-10801","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10804","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9963","text":"grounding agent responses in approved content"}]}],"id":"blk-10803","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10805","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9964","text":"Research systems"}]},{"id":"blk-10806","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10808","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9965","text":"corpus-level semantic search over papers, notes, and claims"}]}],"id":"blk-10807","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9966","text":"literature retrieval for evidence synthesis"}]}],"id":"blk-10809","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9967","text":"semantic matching of new findings against prior work"}]}],"id":"blk-10811","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10813","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9968","text":"Compliance and policy"}]},{"id":"blk-10814","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10816","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9969","text":"regulatory document retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-10815","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10818","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9970","text":"policy section lookup for audit or review workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-10817","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10820","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9971","text":"grounding decisions in authoritative source material"}]}],"id":"blk-10819","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10821","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9972","text":"General agent grounding"}]},{"id":"blk-10822","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10824","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9973","text":"semantic context enrichment before reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-10823","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10826","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9974","text":"document retrieval for RAG (retrieval-augmented generation) pipelines"}]}],"id":"blk-10825","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10828","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9975","text":"knowledge-base maintenance through upsert workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-10827","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10829","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9976","text":"15. Anti-patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-10830","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9977","text":"Avoid these mistakes when modeling "},{"id":"spn-9978","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9979","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-10831","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9980","text":"Anti-pattern 1: treating vector retrieval as relationship-aware"}]},{"id":"blk-10832","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9981","text":"Vector memory finds what is similar in embedding space. It does not know how things connect. If relationship structure matters, use "},{"id":"spn-9982","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9983","text":" instead or alongside."}]},{"id":"blk-10833","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9984","text":"Anti-pattern 2: collapsing provider and capability"}]},{"id":"blk-10834","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9985","marks":["code"],"text":"pgvector"},{"id":"spn-9986","text":" is not the protocol capability. "},{"id":"spn-9987","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9988","text":" is."}]},{"id":"blk-10835","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9989","text":"Anti-pattern 3: using vector retrieval without provenance"}]},{"id":"blk-10836","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9990","text":"If retrieved content influences action, the retrieval step should be preserved in the provenance chain."}]},{"id":"blk-10837","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9991","text":"Anti-pattern 4: using vector memory as the only memory capability"}]},{"id":"blk-10838","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9992","text":"Vector retrieval is strong for corpus search but does not replace session history ("},{"id":"spn-9993","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-9994","text":") or structured relationship memory ("},{"id":"spn-9995","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9996","text":"). In many systems, "},{"id":"spn-9997","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9998","text":" works best as one layer in a multi-memory architecture."}]},{"id":"blk-10839","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9999","text":"Anti-pattern 5: assuming embedding quality is uniform"}]},{"id":"blk-10840","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10000","text":"Different embedding models produce different quality results for different domains. The capability abstraction is stable, but provider configuration (embedding model, chunking strategy, distance metric) affects retrieval quality significantly."}]},{"id":"blk-10841","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-10001","text":"16. Related capabilities"}]},{"id":"blk-10842","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10002","text":"Closest related protocol capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-10843","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10845","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10003","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"}]}],"id":"blk-10844","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10847","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10004","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"}]}],"id":"blk-10846","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10849","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10005","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-10848","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10850","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10006","text":"Common high-value compositions:"}]},{"id":"blk-10851","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10853","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10007","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-10008","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-10009","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-10010","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-10011","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"},{"id":"spn-10012","text":" (policy-grounded support)"}]}],"id":"blk-10852","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10855","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10013","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-10014","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-10015","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-10016","text":" (hybrid retrieval)"}]}],"id":"blk-10854","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10857","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10017","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-10018","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-10019","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"},{"id":"spn-10020","text":" (grounded reasoning over retrieved evidence)"}]}],"id":"blk-10856","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10858","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-10021","text":"17. Research references"}]},{"id":"blk-10859","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10022","text":"This capability is informed by both information retrieval research and modern retrieval-augmented generation architecture."}]},{"id":"blk-10860","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10023","text":"Useful reference directions:"}]},{"id":"blk-10861","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10863","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10024","text":"dense passage retrieval and bi-encoder models"}]}],"id":"blk-10862","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10865","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10025","text":"approximate nearest neighbor search (HNSW, IVF, product quantization)"}]}],"id":"blk-10864","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10867","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10026","text":"retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems"}]}],"id":"blk-10866","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10027","text":"hybrid search combining vector and keyword retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-10868","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10871","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10028","text":"embedding model evaluation and domain adaptation"}]}],"id":"blk-10870","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10873","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10029","text":"vector database architecture and scaling patterns"}]}],"id":"blk-10872","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10875","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10030","text":"chunking and document segmentation strategies for retrieval quality"}]}],"id":"blk-10874","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10031","text":"The protocol does not prescribe a specific embedding model or retrieval algorithm. The value of this capability is in the stable interface, not the implementation details."}]},{"id":"blk-10877","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-10032","text":"18. Summary"}]},{"id":"blk-10878","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10033","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-10034","text":" is the [&] Protocol capability for semantic vector retrieval."}]},{"id":"blk-10879","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10035","text":"It is the right capability when an agent needs:"}]},{"id":"blk-10880","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10882","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10036","text":"corpus-level semantic search"}]}],"id":"blk-10881","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10037","text":"knowledge-base grounding for responses"}]}],"id":"blk-10883","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10886","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10038","text":"document retrieval by meaning rather than exact terms"}]}],"id":"blk-10885","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10039","text":"context enrichment from embedded corpora"}]}],"id":"blk-10887","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10890","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10040","text":"a write path for keeping the knowledge base current"}]}],"id":"blk-10889","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10891","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10041","text":"In one sentence:"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10893","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-10042","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-10043","text":" lets an agent find what is semantically relevant across a knowledge corpus."}]}],"id":"blk-10892","kind":"quote"}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierahplibqdqqqpjv4vkk6y5vtwdvjwisbsyezy3xnjtkspblf3pepya","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}